Id: ssh012w
Severity: WARN
Category: ssh
Check: check_ssh
Fix: Set LoginGraceTime 60.
References: sshd_config(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1, 5.4; NIST AC-17, IA-2; ISO 8.5, 8.20; CE Secure configuration, User access control

LoginGraceTime is above 60 seconds, so an unauthenticated connection
can tie up a slot for longer than it needs to, which makes exhausting
MaxStartups easier. Set it to 60 or less.
